# The credentials op run puts into the mail server's environment (Suite D7,
# D106). Each value is an op:// reference, never the value; the real file,
# with the Bud vault's paths, lives in the overlay. The password is an
# iCloud app-specific password (appleid.apple.com, Sign-In and Security),
# made for Bud, in the same "iCloud" item the calendar server reads.
# BUD_MAIL_FROM is the iCloud address mail goes out from, the item's email
# field; leave it out to turn sending off.
BUD_MAIL_USER=op://vault/iCloud/username
BUD_MAIL_PASSWORD=op://vault/iCloud/password
BUD_MAIL_FROM=op://vault/iCloud/email
